# {{ alg.name }}

{% if alg.long_name %}_{{ alg.long_name }}_

{% endif %}> {{ alg.summary }}

<div class="crdt-badges">
{% for k in alg.kind %}
<span class="badge">{{ k }}</span>
{% endfor %}
<span class="badge">{{ alg.family }}</span>
<span class="badge">{{ alg.difficulty }}</span>
{% if alg.rust.status %}
<span class="badge">Rust: {{ alg.rust.status }}</span>
{% endif %}
{% if alg.proofs.lean %}
<span class="badge">Lean: {{ alg.proofs.lean.status }}</span>
{% endif %}
{% if alg.proofs.tla %}
<span class="badge">TLA+: {{ alg.proofs.tla.status }}</span>
{% endif %}
</div>

## Metadata

| Field | Value |
| --- | --- |
| ID | `{{ alg.id }}` |
| Family | `{{ alg.family }}` |
| Kind | `{% for k in alg.kind %}{{ k }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}` |
| Difficulty | `{{ alg.difficulty }}` |
| Rust type | `{{ alg.rust.module }}::{{ alg.rust.type }}` |

{% if alg.delivery %}
## Delivery

| Assumption | Required or tolerated |
| --- | --- |
| Causal delivery required | {% if alg.delivery.causal_required %}Yes{% else %}No{% endif %} |
| Duplicate delivery tolerated | {% if alg.delivery.duplicate_tolerant %}Yes{% else %}No{% endif %} |
| Message drops tolerated | {% if alg.delivery.drop_tolerant %}Yes, with eventual anti-entropy{% else %}No{% endif %} |
| Exactly-once delivery required | {% if alg.delivery.exactly_once_required %}Yes{% else %}No{% endif %} |
{% endif %}

